* ADP7118 1.8V Low-Dropout Regulator
* Input: 3.3V, Output: 1.8V, Load: 50mA

* Input Voltage Source
V1 IN 0 3.3

* Input Decoupling Capacitor
Cin IN 0 2.2u

* ADP7118 LDO Instance
* Pin order: IN EN GND SS BYP SENSE OUT
X1 IN IN 0 SS BYP SENSE OUT ADP7118

* Soft-Start and Bypass Capacitors
Css SS 0 1n
Cbyp BYP 0 1u

* Feedback Divider for 1.8V Output
* ADP7118 Adjustable Vref = 1.2V
* Vout = 1.2V * (1 + R1/R2) => 1.8V = 1.2V * (1 + 10k/20k)
R1 OUT SENSE 10k
R2 SENSE 0 20k

* Output Decoupling Capacitor
Cout OUT 0 2.2u

* 50mA Resistive Load (1.8V / 36 Ohms = 50mA)
Rload OUT 0 36

* Simulation Directive
.tran 10m

* Include ADI Component Library
.lib ADI.lib

.end
